	                     "SuiteSparse libraries, notably CHOLMOD and AMD",
	                     "collaborators listed in dir(pattern=\"^[A-Z]+[.]txt$\", full.names=TRUE, system.file(\"doc\", \"SuiteSparse\", package=\"Matrix\"))")),
