R package Matrix is developed on R-Forge and released on CRAN.  It has
two components:

1. The source code of Matrix, excluding external libraries, is contained
   primarily in R/*.R, src/*.[ch] (excluding cs.[ch]), man/*.Rd, tests/*.R, vignettes/*.Rnw,
   inst/*.R, and inst/include/*.  It is licensed under the GNU GPL,
   version 3, pasted below.  The files were created and are maintained
   by Douglas Bates, Martin Maechler, and Mikael Jagan, hence they are:

   Copyright (C) 1999-2020 Douglas Bates, Martin Maechler
   Copyright (C) 2021-2023 Douglas Bates, Martin Maechler, Mikael Jagan

2. Matrix contains patched versions of external libraries CSparse, AMD,
   COLAMD, and CHOLMOD, all from the SuiteSparse collection of Timothy
   A. Davis.  AMD and COLAMD use the BSD 3-clause licence.  CSparse and
   modules Check, Cholesky, and Core of CHOLMOD use the GNU LGPL licence,
   version 2.1 or greater.  Modules MatrixOps, Modify, and Supernodal of
   CHOLMOD use the GNU GPL licence, version 2 or greater.  Licence files
   and copyrights are copied under inst/doc/SuiteSparse.

